msgstr "``view_size()``"

#: ../../guide/embedding.rst:69
msgid "The ``(width, height)`` of the view in logical pixels."
msgstr "논리 픽셀 단위의 뷰 ``(width, height)``."

#: ../../guide/embedding.rst:70
msgid "``scale()``"
msgstr "``scale()``"

