msgstr "``clipboard_get()``, ``clipboard_set(text)``"

#: ../../guide/embedding.rst:94
msgid "Copy, cut and paste (from keys and from the context menu) through the clipboard of the toolkit."
msgstr "툴킷의 클립보드를 통한 복사, 잘라내기, 붙여넣기(키 입력과 컨텍스트 메뉴에서)."

#: ../../guide/embedding.rst:95
